# Only the LaTeX source (User_Guide.tex) is tracked here.
# The compiled PDF ships as a GitHub Release asset, and the figures are kept
# out of git (oversized screenshots). Everything below is intentionally ignored.

# LaTeX build artifacts
*.aux
*.fls
*.fdb_latexmk
*.log
*.out
*.toc
*.synctex.gz

# Compiled guide (shipped as a Release asset, not in git history)
*.pdf

# Oversized screenshot figures (not tracked) - except the README hero image,
# which is small (682K) and needs to be in-repo to render on GitHub.
Figures/*
!Figures/GUI_wallpaper.png
